    "https://jobs.cofc.edu/postings/18692": {
      "title": "Adjunct Instructor of French or Italian",
      "description": "College of Charleston Employment Site | Adjunct Instructor of French or Italian Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Applicant Log In /Create Account Help Human Resources Academic Jobs Student Jobs Contact Us Adjunct Instructor of French or Italian Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Posting Details General Information Rank Adjunct Instructor FLSA Exempt Position Type Adjunct Internal Title Adjunct Instructor of French or Italian Department French, Francophone, and Italian St School/Area School of LCWA Posting Number A2026022P Specialty and subspecialty, if any, sought Courses to be covered Position Description Adjunct Lecturer of French or Italian to teach language and culture courses in person (on our historic downtown Charleston campus) and online. This is a non-tenure track faculty position with the possibility of renewal based on departmental needs and performance. We are seeking dynamic and student-focused educators committed to fostering language acquisition and cultural competence through communicative and participatory teaching practices. Offers are subject to background checks, sufficient enrollments, and available budgets. Special Instructions to Applicants Is this position Grant funded? No EEO Statement The College of Charleston is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate against any individual or group on the basis of sex, gender (including gender identity and/or expression), pregnancy, race, religion, color, national origin, age, disability, military or veteran status, sexual orientation, genetic information, and other classifications protected by applicable federal, state, and local laws. For more information, please visit eop.cofc.edu . Quicklink for Posting https://jobs.cofc.edu/postings/18383 Reference Letters Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * How did you hear about this employment opportunity? Chronicle of Higher Education CofC - Alumni Career Services College of Charleston Website Diverse: Issues in Higher Education Glassdoor Handshake HigherEdJobs Indeed.com Internal Job Posting jbcjobs (Joint Base Charleston Military & Family Readiness) Job Fair LinkedIn Monster.com Personal Referral Post and Courier Public Job Posting SC Works (SC Department of Employment and Workforce) Twitter Word of mouth Other National Labor Exchange CareerBuilder SpouseWorks Applicant Documents Required Documents Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents Resume Cover Letter / Letter of Application Teaching Philosophy Research and Professional Development Statement Unofficial Graduate Transcripts Sample Publication 1 Sample Publication 2 Sample Publication 3 Student Course-Instructor Reviews Teaching Portfolio Philosophy of Advising Statement Philosophy of Student Success & Retention Syllabi Email: jobs@cofc.edu General Information: 843.953.5512 Mailing Address: 66 George St. Charleston, SC 29424 HR Office 160 Calhoun St. Lightsey Building B36 Charleston, SC 29424 Campus Maps ©2020 All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
