    "https://jobs.cofc.edu/postings/18687": {
      "title": "Engineering Adjunct Faculty",
      "description": "College of Charleston Employment Site | Engineering Adjunct Faculty Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Applicant Log In /Create Account Help Human Resources Academic Jobs Student Jobs Contact Us Engineering Adjunct Faculty Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Posting Details General Information Rank Adjunct FLSA Exempt Position Type Adjunct Internal Title Engineering Adjunct Faculty Department Engineering School/Area School of Engineering, Computing, and Mathematics Posting Number A2026013P Specialty and subspecialty, if any, sought A graduate degree in engineering, or a graduate degree in a related field with at least 18 graduate credit hours in engineering. Courses to be covered ENGR 103 Fundamentals of Engineering Position Description The new and growing College of Charleston Department of Engineering invites applications for adjunct faculty to teach undergraduate courses in systems engineering, electrical engineering, and core engineering subjects. Areas of instructional need include: · Electrical and Mechanical Systems · Human Factors · Design and Development · Discrete Modeling and Simulation · Circuits and Electronics · Control Systems · Electromechanics and Electromagnetics · Fundamentals of Engineering · Engineering Graphics ( CAD -focused) Special Instructions to Applicants Is this position Grant funded? No EEO Statement The College of Charleston is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate against any individual or group on the basis of sex, gender (including gender identity and/or expression), pregnancy, race, religion, color, national origin, age, disability, military or veteran status, sexual orientation, genetic information, and other classifications protected by applicable federal, state, and local laws. For more information, please visit eop.cofc.edu . Quicklink for Posting https://jobs.cofc.edu/postings/18300 Reference Lett